[{"id":178036188,"discussion_id":"d5f932b528b76fa0ce0d5986a0ffd87f9d4c3779","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-transformer/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| moe | ✅ [*宋恺*](https://gitcode.com/songkai111), [*guoqiuhao*](https://gitcode.com/guoqiuhao) (2/2) | ✅ [*宋恺*](https://gitcode.com/songkai111) (1/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n\n------\n\n## CLA Signature Pass  \n cpy_123456, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-07-01T15:20:04+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-01T22:07:30+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178037251,"discussion_id":"31fa27f1af545cd179e941d5e1f133cc871c6674","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n此 PR 修复了 `ComputeFp8GroupQuantVF` 函数中因 `UpdateMask` 对传入参数具有引用递减副作用，导致直接使用 `groupElemNum` 时其值被意外修改，进而污染后续阶段的计数器状态。修复方式是为输入和输出处理阶段分别引入独立的局部变量 `inputElemNum` 和 `outputElemNum`，隔离 `UpdateMask` 的副作用影响。同时调整了部分函数签名的代码对齐格式。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **引入独立局部变量隔离 `UpdateMask` 副作用**：在 `ComputeFp8GroupQuantVF` 中新增 `inputElemNum` 和 `outputElemNum` 两个局部变量，均初始化为 `groupElemNum`，分别用于输入 abs-max 计算阶段和输出量化阶段的 mask 操作与条件判断，避免 `UpdateMask` 对原始 `groupElemNum` 的引用递减污染后续逻辑。\n- **输入阶段改用 `inputElemNum`**：将输入阶段的 `maskLoop = UpdateMask<float>(groupElemNum)` 替换为 `maskLoop = UpdateMask<float>(inputElemNum)`，同时将对应的条件判断 `groupElemNum > vfLen` 和 `groupElemNum > 0` 替换为 `inputElemNum` 版本。\n- **输出阶段改用 `outputElemNum`**：将输出阶段的 `maskLoop = UpdateMask<float>(groupElemNum)` 替换为 `maskLoop = UpdateMask<float>(outputElemNum)`，同时将对应的条件判断替换为 `outputElemNum` 版本。\n- **函数签名格式对齐**：对 `ComputeFp8GroupQuantVF`、`InitKernelTiling`、`CopyIn`、`Compute`、`CopyOut` 等函数的参数列表进行了缩进对齐调整，`Compute` 函数签名合并为单行。\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-01T15:22:50+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-01T15:22:50+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178047520,"discussion_id":"bc79d82364cf1355e01166a4536e198f64d19e13","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-07-01T15:51:20+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-01T15:51:20+08:00","user":{"id":"670a36a75010ca4fc3a7bfbe","login":"cpy_123456","object_id":"670a36a75010ca4fc3a7bfbe","name":"cpy_123456","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cpy_123456"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178048293,"discussion_id":"e334180634faf5ce938841d8aa555d6866177c5e","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=3537b826c3c54622a4fd365051123f9e&pipelineRunId=061c534453114cc3942b6467610bac47&projectName=CANN'>061c534453114cc3942b6467610bac47</a></b>][<b><a href='https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/ci/ci_guide.md'>流水线指导</a></b>]\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse\"><tr><th>任务名称</th><th>状态</th><th>日志</t